isofill (0.8.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * isofill_run_ex(): the same fill with the first pass kept, for a caller
    that wants both the finished surface and a reading of the cells the first
    pass could not answer. The first pass is nearly all of the run, so that
    caller was doing the whole thing twice and throwing one surface away.
    isofill_run() is this with a null second output and is unchanged.

